    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, the Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the UniversityGrants Commission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, publishedin Gazette Extraordinary No. 1400/24 of July 08, 2005 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 1686/22 of December 29, 2010), establishing the University of the Visual and Performing Arts, by the additonimmediately after the entry \u201c6. Department of Musicology\u201d in Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item\u201cFaculty of Music\u201d in Column I of that Schedule, of the following entry :-",
